--
--   This is `NLogN.KFY.hdlAN` from xuanji's $\kappa = 2^{-182}$ formalization (statement and proof unchanged) with the constants of §8 replaced by those of the community patch `frozen-154`: $\varepsilon = c = 2^{-51}$, $\lambda' = 1 - 2^{-102}$ ($\tau = 1 - 2^{-50}$ and $\delta = 1/16$ unchanged). The parameter map $d = \lfloor b^{\varepsilon} \rfloor$, $K = \lfloor d^{c} \rfloor$, $\ell = \lceil L/d \rceil$, $\alpha = \lceil (12 d^2 b)^{1/4} \rceil$, $r = 2^{\ell}$ is the one of `Def_IntMul_OpenAI_R154`, and every constant-dependent name lives under `IntMul.OpenAI.R154.P`.
--
--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *KFY 17: the numeric parameters of the passes*.
-- source:
